{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "56e79741-e02e-89c5-82c5-aad61c05619d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T13:31:07-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carlos Pacheco",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:29:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:29:22-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Yes, I am calling about my trash. It was not picked up on the usual day, and I confess I do not understand why. Kindly forgive me if I am on the wrong line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:29:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're in the right place. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:29:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 354 Gidley Street. In the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:29:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "354 Gidley Street. And what's your usual pickup day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:29:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tuesday, I believed. But perhaps it is Wednesday now? I was told something about a holiday, and the schedule moving, but I did not follow it. [pause] I put the barrel out on Tuesday morning, and it was still sitting there this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:30:00-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So you put it out Tuesday and it's still there Thursday. Holidays can push the schedule back a day, so I'd want to check which day your route actually ran this week. Did you put out recycling too, or just trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:30:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only the trash, I think. Is the recycling a different barrel? Kindly explain that to me again, I am a little unsure which is which."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Trash and recycling are separate and they don't always go the same week. I can't tell you from here whether your route got missed or just shifted, so I'd like a supervisor to look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that would be most kind. I would like the supervisor to telephone me, if that is possible. Please take your time. I am not in any hurry. I have all afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:30:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Let me read back what I have. Trash not picked up, 354 Gidley Street, supervisor to call you back. What number should they use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:30:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0180."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:30:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0180. Got it. Leave the barrel at the curb for now, and they'll call you and sort out the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:31:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you kindly. I will leave it there, then. Good day to you."
    }
  ],
